  "body": "https://github.com/w3c/reporting/pull/253 changed the exported `<dfn>` to be the one that actually sends a report.\r\n\r\nhttps://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/origin.html#coop-violation-navigation-to and maybe other places link to https://w3c.github.io/reporting/#queue-report, the header of the old definition, but they should now target `[=generate and queue a report=]`. I missed this in the initial cleanup because only links to definitions appear in https://dontcallmedom.github.io/webdex/g.html#generate%20and%20queue%20a%20report%40%40reporting%25%25dfn.",
